{"curationManifestSha256":"98e90b3603b34b437bc554810c21f01c4db44d10364211af114d30fde3d67bad","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1692-p3","main":{"annotations":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"选自《昌耀抒情诗集》（青海人民出版社1986 年版）。峨日朵雪峰在青海海北藏族自治州内，是祁连山脉的一座无名山，靠近祁连县峨堡镇，山顶终年积雪。 *作者在诗中借称这座山为“峨日朵雪峰”。昌耀（1936—2000），原名王昌耀，湖南桃源人，诗人。代表作有诗歌《划呀，划呀，父亲们！》《意绪》等。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11124-5"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"揳（xiē）：把楔子、钉子等捶打到物体里面。这里指用力插入。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11124-6"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"罅（xià）隙：缝隙。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11124-7"}],"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"峨日朵雪峰之侧","type":"text"},{"label":"[1]","noteId":"footnote-11124-5","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"\n\n昌耀","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"这是我此刻仅能征服的高度了：\n\n我小心地探出前额，\n\n惊异于薄壁那边\n\n朝向峨日朵之雪彷徨许久的太阳\n\n正决然跃入一片引力无穷的山海。\n\n石砾不时滑坡，\n\n引动棕色深渊自上而下的一派嚣鸣，\n\n像军旅远去的喊杀声。\n\n我的指关节铆钉一样揳","type":"text"},{"label":"[2]","noteId":"footnote-11124-6","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"入巨石的罅隙","type":"text"},{"label":"[3]","noteId":"footnote-11124-7","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"血滴，从撕裂的千层掌鞋底渗出。\n\n啊，真渴望有一只雄鹰或雪豹与我为伍。\n\n在锈蚀的岩壁，\n\n但有一只小得可怜的蜘蛛\n\n与我一同默享着这大自然赐予的快慰。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"1962 年8 月2 日初稿\n\n1983 年7 月27 日删定","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"frontMatter":[],"guidance":[],"links":[],"media":[],"sourceOnlyBlocks":[],"sourcePostId":"11124-3","sourcePostNumber":1},"mediaReceiptLedgerSha256":"5487243dd8d14d65dfadc20ed544a999aaa318fc20c291462ea62c69e1eff320","mediaReceiptLedgerVersion":"2026-07-30.2","provenance":{"links":[{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11124-1","postId":"11124-3","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11124-1","text":"[1]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11124-2","postId":"11124-3","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11124-2","text":"[2]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11124-3","postId":"11124-3","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11124-3","text":"[3]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11124-4","postId":"11124-3","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11124-4","text":"[4]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11124-5","postId":"11124-3","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11124-5","text":"[5]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11124-6","postId":"11124-3","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11124-6","text":"[6]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11124-7","postId":"11124-3","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11124-7","text":"[7]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11124-8","postId":"11124-3","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11124-8","text":"[8]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-ref-11124-1","postId":"11124-3","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-ref-11124-1","text":"↩︎","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-ref-11124-2","postId":"11124-3","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-ref-11124-2","text":"↩︎","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-ref-11124-3","postId"